## Install

From a local path (typical after generating):

```ruby
# Gemfile
gem <%= gem_name.inspect %>, path: <%= "generated/#{gem_name}".inspect %>
```

```bash
bundle install
```

Or in this directory:

```bash
bundle install
```

## Configure credentials

```ruby
require <%= gem_name.inspect %>

<%= module_name %>.configure do |config|
  config.api_key = ENV.fetch("<%= module_name.upcase %>_API_KEY")
<% if a.auth_kind == :basic -%>
  config.secret  = ENV.fetch("<%= module_name.upcase %>_SECRET")
<% end -%>
<% if a.has_webhooks -%>
  config.webhook_secret = ENV.fetch("<%= module_name.upcase %>_WEBHOOK_SECRET")
<% end -%>
  config.environment = :sandbox # :live for production
  config.timeout = 30
end
```

Auth details: [docs/AUTH.md](docs/AUTH.md). Full operation catalog: [docs/API.md](docs/API.md).

