## Regenerating

```bash
bundle exec rubyroad generate path/to/openapi.yaml --out <%= "generated/#{gem_name}" %> --name <%= gem_name %>
```

Regeneration overwrites these files. Keep merchant-specific code outside `lib/` or regenerate onto a fresh directory.
